================================================================================
FILE INTEGRITY MONITORING - C:\USERS\OK\DOWNLOADS
================================================================================

TARGET: Windows Agent
PURPOSE: Monitor folder Downloads secara realtime

================================================================================
CONFIG ( untuk ossec.conf ):
================================================================================

<ossec_config>
  <syscheck>
    <!-- Monitor Downloads folder -->
    <directories check_all="yes" realtime="yes">C:\Users\ok\Downloads</directories>

    <!-- Ignore temporary/download files -->
    <ignore type="sregex">\.tmp$</ignore>
    <ignore type="sregex">\.crdownload$</ignore>
    <ignore type="sregex">\.part$</ignore>
    <ignore type="sregex">\.partial$</ignore>
  </syscheck>
</ossec_config>

================================================================================
CARA APPLY:
================================================================================

1. Edit file: C:\Program Files (x86)\ossec-agent\ossec.conf
2. Cari section <syscheck>
3. Ganti/tambahkan dengan config di atas
4. Restart agent:

   net stop ossec
   net start ossec

================================================================================
VERIFIKASI:
================================================================================

1. Buka https://localhost:443
2. Menu: Security Events
3. Filter: "C:\\Users\\ok\\Downloads"

================================================================================
ALERT RULES:
================================================================================

rule.id: 554 = file added
rule.id: 550 = file modified
rule.id: 553 = file deleted

